ull}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-18T06:08:31Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T17:22:42Z","closed_at":"2026-08-19T17:22:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122526","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122526","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122526.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122526.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-19T17:22:26Z"},"body":"This is a great optimization suggested by @Schnorg .\r\nIt makes the hot checks branchless using `std::signbit` instead of `if` branches.\r\n\r\nForward port of #122508\r\n\r\nThe compiler apparently isn't able to make the old `if` versions branchless by default (although it may be able to be forced to, using fast math flags).\r\n\r\nThe reason is that:\r\n* original code has a quick exit which introduces control-flow dependency\r\n* with branchless it does every axis, even if one fails (although this seems more expensive, it can work out cheaper because branchless)\r\n* NaN and -0.0 must be treated as special cases for IEEE 754 in the old code\r\n* the \"cost heuristic\" of doing the early exit is hard for the compiler to know _a priori_\r\n \r\n## Notes\r\n* The behaviour on the exact border (i.e. +0 and -0) could be different, however in practice the BVH uses margins so this shouldn't matter.\r\n* This doesn't always seem to yield an obvious speedup, but seems to in e.g. physics when a lot of objects are overlapping.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"